---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { workflowSections } from '../../lib/workflow';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/paths';

const backboneSections = workflowSections.filter((section) => ['A', 'B', 'C'].includes(section.id));
const targetSection = workflowSections.find((section) => section.id === 'D');
const completionSection = workflowSections.find((section) => section.id === 'E');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Research Workflow"
  description="A question-led A–E DFT manual: define the required observable, select a bounded target calculation, and follow evidence back when necessary."
  current="operations"
>
  <article class="workflow-manual">
    <header class="workflow-lede">
      <p class="kicker">Question first · observable next · calculation last</p>
      <h1>Calculate what the question requires</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">
        Do not begin by asking which calculation is customary. State the scientific question, name the observable that could answer it, define the comparison and precision required, and only then choose a target branch. A–C establish a defensible model and reference state; D is a branching calculation library; E tests whether the resulting evidence supports the intended conclusion.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="observable-selection" aria-labelledby="observable-heading">
      <header>
        <p>Four bounded examples</p>
        <h2 id="observable-heading">A question determines its evidence</h2>
      </header>
      <dl>
        <div>
          <dt>Which same-composition polymorph is lower in static-lattice energy at 0 K?</dt>
          <dd><strong>Required observable:</strong> a matched energy difference per formula unit, with numerical uncertainty small enough to resolve the ranking. One isolated total energy cannot answer the comparison.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Is the fundamental gap direct or indirect within the chosen approximation?</dt>
          <dd><strong>Required observable:</strong> valence- and conduction-band extrema, their k-points, and the gap from adequate Brillouin-zone coverage. A high-symmetry path alone is not a full-zone search.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Is the reference crystal dynamically stable in the harmonic approximation?</dt>
          <dd><strong>Required observable:</strong> phonon frequencies over the q-space needed by the claim, with displacement or q-mesh convergence and numerical artifact checks. A Γ-point result is not a general stability test.</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>What electron–phonon estimate of Tc follows for a stated Coulomb parameter?</dt>
          <dd><strong>Required observable:</strong> converged α²F(ω), λ, ω<sub>log</sub>, the stated μ*, and the declared Tc equation or solver. SCF convergence and one phonon calculation do not establish Tc.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <figure class="branch-map" aria-labelledby="branch-map-title">
      <figcaption>
        <span>Dependency map</span>
        <strong id="branch-map-title">D branches; E sends evidence back</strong>
      </figcaption>

      <div class="map-backbone" aria-label="A through C research backbone">
        {backboneSections.map((section) => (
          <a href={`#part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}`}>
            <strong>{section.id}</strong>
            <span>{section.title}</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>

      {targetSection && (
        <div class="map-target">
          <div class="map-target-heading">
            <a href="#part-d"><strong>D</strong><span>{targetSection.title}</span></a>
            <p>Choose only the branch or branches required by the observable.</p>
          </div>
          <ul aria-label="Existing D navigation groups">
            {targetSection.groups.map((group) => (
              <li><span>{group.id}</span>{group.title}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      )}

      {completionSection && (
        <div class="map-completion">
          <a href="#part-e"><strong>E</strong><span>{completionSection.title}</span></a>
          <p><b>Feedback:</b> validation, disagreement, or insufficient precision can return the study to A, B, C, or another D branch.</p>
        </div>
      )}
    </figure>

    <section class="topic-directory" aria-labelledby="directory-heading">
      <header class="directory-heading">
        <p>Read by scientific need</p>
        <h2 id="directory-heading">The A–E manual</h2>
      </header>

      {workflowSections.map((section) => (
        <section class="part-section" id={`part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}`} aria-labelledby={`part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}-heading`}>
          <header>
            <h2 id={`part-${section.id.toLowerCase()}-heading`}>{section.id} · {section.title}</h2>
            <p>{section.summary}</p>
          </header>

          {section.groups.map((group) => (
            <div class="workflow-group">
              {section.id === 'D' && <h3>{group.id} · {group.title}</h3>}
              {section.id === 'D' && <p class="group-summary">{group.summary}</p>}
              <ul class="directory-list topic-list">
                {group.topics.map((topic) => (
                  <li><a href={withBase(`operations/${topic.slug}/`)}>{topic.title}</a></li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </div>
          ))}
        </section>
      ))}
    </section>

    <p class="framework-note">
      Older Framework and numbered direct links remain only as migration surfaces. They are not an alternative taxonomy, reading order, or calculation prescription.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .workflow-manual {
    --ink: #181714;
    --muted: #666158;
    --rule: #d9d4ca;
    --accent: #8a3f28;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 76rem;
  }

  .workflow-lede {
    max-width: 61rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .kicker,
  .observable-selection > header > p,
  .directory-heading > p {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.9rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.91;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 11ch;
  }

  .page-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.58;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    max-width: 47em;
  }

  .observable-selection,
  .branch-map,
  .topic-directory,
  .framework-note {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .observable-selection {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.8fr) minmax(20rem, 2fr);
    padding: 1.25rem 0 clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .observable-selection h2,
  .directory-heading h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .observable-selection dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .observable-selection dl > div {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 1rem 0 1.4rem;
  }

  .observable-selection dt {
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .observable-selection dd {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
  }

  .observable-selection dd strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .branch-map {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 0 clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .branch-map figcaption {
    align-items: baseline;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem 2rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .branch-map figcaption span {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .branch-map figcaption strong {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .map-backbone {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.6rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    position: relative;
  }

  .map-backbone::after {
    background: var(--accent);
    content: "";
    height: 1px;
    left: 1.25rem;
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.25rem;
    top: 1.25rem;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .map-backbone a,
  .map-target-heading a,
  .map-completion a {
    align-items: baseline;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    position: relative;
    text-decoration: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .map-backbone a::before {
    background: #fff;
    bottom: -0.3rem;
    content: "";
    left: -0.25rem;
    position: absolute;
    right: -0.25rem;
    top: -0.3rem;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .map-backbone strong,
  .map-target-heading strong,
  .map-completion strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .map-backbone span,
  .map-target-heading span,
  .map-completion span {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .map-target {
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.75fr) minmax(22rem, 2fr);
    margin: 2.2rem 0;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    position: relative;
  }

  .map-target::before {
    color: var(--accent);
    content: "↓";
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    left: 1rem;
    position: absolute;
    top: -2rem;
  }

  .map-target-heading p,
  .map-completion p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }

  .map-target ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .map-target li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 0.72rem 0;
  }

  .map-target li span {
    color: var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    min-width: 2.4rem;
  }

  .map-completion {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, 0.75fr) minmax(20rem, 2fr);
    padding-bottom: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .map-completion::before {
    color: var(--accent);
    content: "↺";
    font-size: 2rem;
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: -0.2rem;
  }

  .map-completion p {
    margin: 0;
    padding-right: 3rem;
  }

  .map-completion b {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .map-backbone a:hover span,
  .map-backbone a:focus-visible span,
  .map-target-heading a:hover span,
  .map-target-heading a:focus-visible span,
  .map-completion a:hover span,
  .map-completion a:focus-visible span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .topic-directory {
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .directory-heading {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.8fr) minmax(20rem, 2fr);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .directory-heading > p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .part-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem 4rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.8fr) minmax(20rem, 2fr);
    padding: 1.5rem 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .part-section > header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.8vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .part-section > header p,
  .group-summary {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .part-section > header p {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
  }

  .workflow-group {
    grid-column: 2;
  }

  .workflow-group + .workflow-group {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .workflow-group h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .group-summary {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .topic-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .topic-list li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .topic-list a {
    color: inherit;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.35;
    padding: 0.72rem 1.8rem 0.72rem 0;
    position: relative;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .topic-list a::after {
    color: var(--accent);
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
  }

  .topic-list a:hover,
  .topic-list a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .framework-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.2rem 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .workflow-lede {
      padding-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 17vw, 5.25rem);
    }

    .observable-selection,
    .directory-heading,
    .part-section {
      display: block;
    }

    .observable-selection > header,
    .directory-heading {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .observable-selection dl {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .branch-map figcaption {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .map-backbone {
      gap: 1.8rem;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .map-backbone::after {
      bottom: 1.25rem;
      height: auto;
      left: 1.1rem;
      right: auto;
      top: 1.25rem;
      width: 1px;
    }

    .map-backbone a::before {
      right: auto;
      width: 12rem;
    }

    .map-target,
    .map-completion {
      display: block;
    }

    .map-target ul {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .map-completion p {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .workflow-group {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
